Ratan OS — Authorized Security Live

Use this image only on systems and networks for which you have explicit written authorization.
This build includes controlled web-assessment tools (SQLMap, Gobuster and FFUF)
only for the written scope, approved targets, and agreed request rate in your engagement.
It intentionally omits DDoS/load-generation, credential attacks, phishing, stealth,
persistence, destructive tooling, and data-exfiltration workflows.

Useful first steps:
  sentinel-audit ~/audit.txt     Local defensive baseline report
  wireshark                     Packet analysis
  nmap                          Authorized service discovery
  sqlmap / gobuster / ffuf      Authorized web assessment (scope and rate limits first)
  lynis audit system            Host hardening review
  ufw enable                    Enable the uncomplicated firewall

Keep evidence and reports inside the approved case directory.
